        "list": [
            {
                "content": "```\nInput: root = [5,6,1]\nOutput: 6.00000\nExplanation: For the node with value = 5 we have an average of (5 + 6 + 1) / 3 = 4. For the node with value = 6 we have an average of 6 / 1 = 6. So the answer is 6 which is the maximum.\n```"
